  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INTERNATIONAL CENTER FOR NOT FOR PROFIT LAW</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICNL work with partners from civil society, government, and the international community developing long-term relationships to advance reforms. They are a global organization focused on the laws affecting civil society, philanthropy, and public participation, and  provide unique expertise on these areas. ICNL aim to support local capacity, not to supplant it, with their partners  in the driving seat of reform, and ICNL work with them to make fully informed decisions. Their contributions are locally relevant and based on their global expertise. Our work is rooted in universal principles and norms of international law and embodies our commitment to nurture the legal environment at all levels, from the local to global.</narrative>
  </description>
